Z||000002||AusFiero||07-22-2001||05:46 AM||||The manufacturer should have a boss kit available to suit your Fiero. If not you could do as I did and have a mounting plate made up and use the boss kit off an existing Fiero steering wheel.<P>I will have steering wheels to suit Fieros soon on  <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>www.auto-alley.com</A> . Have then available but haven't had time to put them up online due to recent surgery. <P>Let me know what price you get as I could probably beat it on most wheels anyway with shipping and insurance included in the price. People around here will vouch for my service on supplying them products.<P>Hope that helps you out.<BR>Below is the wheel I have fitted to my car. It is one of dozens of styles and makes I can supply.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/interior01_5.jpg">  <P><BR>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A><p>[This message has been edited by AusFiero (edited 07-22-2001).]||202.139.20.3||reg||1
